  "governance": "Token ids are ArchSmith semantic ids, independent of source-system names. Adding or changing a token is a governed change-request. Icons are color-free 24×24 geometry built only from the allow-listed circle, ellipse, line, polyline, and rounded-rectangle primitives. The renderer supplies color and a 2px rounded outline; no registry entry can contain arbitrary SVG markup or a path string.",
